 - **Correct:** R = (j₀−q₀−2)l₀ − (3s₀−2j₀+6q₀²+50q₀+40)s₀ − [(3q₀+10)j₀+11q₀²+4q₀−18]j₀ − (3q₀⁴+34q₀³+180q₀²+246q₀+104); correct − printed = −2(3j₀²q₀+10j₀²+11j₀q₀²+4j₀q₀+90q₀²). The printed P₀…Q₃ (11.25)–(11.30) are right. (11.13): the 2(q₀+4)j₀ term has a minus sign (correct − printed = 24H₀⁵j₀(q₀+4)). (11.18)/(11.20) also print +ḢṘ for −ḢṘ (misprint; P/Q were computed with the right sign).
